10","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"さっそく試してみよう…","ts":"1632383737.471300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uFxzp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3852d2ac-0234-448a-b2d7-30bb0b8ea390","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"おや、ひょっとするとこれを使えばneovimでもCtrlPでやれたりするのかな","ts":"1632383719.470700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SuNp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0997f090-e382-4cb9-b142-e6ebbb060ba9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、なるほど、matchfuzzyはvimだけですもんね","ts":"1632383301.469600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DLRoO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6faa3a61-501c-481e-bc12-4f4b3af6788c","type":"message","user":"UEX9VPSET","text":"`raghur/fruzzy` いいですよ！ Vim だと ctrlp-fuzzymatcher で、 Neovim だと fruzzy 使ってます。\n```if exists('*matchfuzzy')\n  let g:ctrlp_match_func = {'match': 'ctrlp_matchfuzzy#matcher'}\nelse\n  let g:fruzzy#usenative = 1\n  let g:ctrlp_match_func = {'match': 'fruzzy#ctrlp#matcher'}\nendif```","ts":"1632382833.468700","thread_ts":"1632313644.458300","edited":{"user":"UEX9VPSET","ts":"1632382866.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"otxu","count":2,"users":["UAZ33BKV2","U01HFNMNB55"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vrnw"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"79cb5cbd-b857-4230-b0d2-a2144be1276f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ctrlp-fuzzymatcherを推しそうになったけどVim専用だった","ts":"1632313644.458300","thread_ts":"1632313644.458300","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ECf"}]}}]
